<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Mumbai to Imphal | Insured Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does Car Transport From Mumbai To Imphal typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 850 km is covered in 2 to 3 business days under normal traffic conditions. Our hydraulic‑ramp carriers travel on the NH27 corridor with real‑time GPS monitoring, allowing us to provide precise arrival windows and adjust for any unforeseen delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is protected by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This covers accidental damage, theft, and natural events from the moment the vehicle is inspected at the door until it is handed over at the destination, ensuring a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are vehicles loaded onto the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained loading crew uses a hydraulic ramp that gently lowers the vehicle onto a multi‑axle carrier equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. The process is overseen by a supervisor, and each step is documented with photos to guarantee safe handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents must I provide for interstate car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the vehicle’s registration certificate, a valid insurance policy, a signed transport agreement, GST invoice, and an e‑Way bill generated for the shipment. Our team also assists with any additional paperwork required by state transport authorities.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for Car Transport From Mumbai To Imphal calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on vehicle size, weight, distance, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling requirements. Our transparent cost breakdown eliminates hidden fees, and the instant quote tool reflects real‑time rates for a fair and competitive price.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the types of cars that can be shipped?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We transport most passenger vehicles, SUVs, and light commercial trucks up to 3.5 tons. Vehicles with extreme modifications, oversized dimensions, or hazardous materials may require special arrangements. Contact our support team for a detailed assessment of any unique requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the zero‑scratch guarantee mean for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee ensures that your car will arrive without any surface damage. This is achieved through our 7‑layer protective packaging, secure lashing, and continuous monitoring. If any scratch occurs, the full repair cost is covered under our insurance policy.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
